            "HTTP/1.1 200 OK\nServer: nginx\nDate: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:16:53 GMT\nContent-Type: application/octet-stream\nContent-Length: 11767\nLast-Modified: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 05:09:55 GMT\nConnection: keep-alive\nETag: \"6afa9023-2df7\"\nAccept-Ranges: bytes"
